                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#b91b55' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='16636' id='79' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='5091'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Definitions:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'>1. Customers:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'> Count of customers who purchased the new PL sku within the month</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'>2. PL SKU Retention rate (30D):</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'> % Customers who repurchased the same sku in the next order within the next 1-30 days of the cohort month order. </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Note the latest &amp; M-1 month for 30D Repeat Purchase Rate will be inaccurate.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'>3. New to Dmart Customers:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'> New to dmart customers with the new PL sku in basket.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'>4. New to Cat 3 Customers:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'> New to category 3 customers with the new PL sku in basket</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'>5. Cat 3 Customer penetration</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'>: Total customers that purchased the new PL SKU/ Total L3 Dmart Customers in the corresponding category in the month</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'>6. Cat 3 Basket penetration:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'> Total orders with at least a unit of new PL SKU/ Total L3 customers in the category 3 in the month</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'>7. Cat 3 GFV Share: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8'>PL SKU GFV Share / PIM 3 Dmart GFV Share</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Underlying data-set is a country-month-sku granularity</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f5f5f5' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='5091' id='257' name='SKUCustomer' param='[federated.1ljaayc07ahko31h8gcxh0d1yqne].[tmn:order_month_local:qk]' type-v2='filter' values='database' w='16500' x='667' y='21727'>
